{"t":"F","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Ford Motor Company","ko":"포드","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","employees":169000,"hq":"Dearborn, MI, United States","website":"https://www.ford.com","summary_en":"Ford Motor Company develops, delivers, and services Ford trucks, sport utility vehicles, commercial vans and cars, and Lincoln luxury vehicles in the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Mexico, and internationally. It operates through Ford Blue, Ford Model e, Ford Pro, and Ford Credit segments. The company sells Ford and Lincoln internal combustion engine and hybrid vehicles, electric vehicles, service parts, accessories, and digital services for retail customers; develops EV and digital vehicle technologies, and software; and provides telematics and EV charging solutions. It also sells Ford and Lincoln vehicles, service parts, and accessories through distributors and dealers, as well as through dealerships to commercial fleet customers, daily rental car companies, and governments. In addition, it engages in vehicle-related financing and leasing activities to and through automotive dealers. Further, the company provides retail installment sale contracts for new and used vehicles; and direct financing leases for new vehicles to retail and commercial customers, such as leasing companies, government entities, daily rental companies, and fleet customers. Additionally, it offers wholesale loans to dealers to finance the purchase of vehicle inventory; and loans to dealers to finance working capital and enhance dealership facilities, purchase dealership real estate, and other dealer vehicle programs. Ford Motor Company was incorporated in 1903 and is based in Dearborn, Michigan.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Ford Motor Company는 미국, 캐나다, 영국, 멕시코 및 전 세계에서 Ford 트럭, 스포츠 유틸리티 차량, 상업용 밴 및 자동차, 링컨 고급 차량을 개발, 배송 및 서비스합니다. Ford Blue, Ford Model e, Ford Pro 및 Ford Credit 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 소매 고객을 위해 Ford 및 Lincoln 내연 기관과 하이브리드 자동차, 전기 자동차, 서비스 부품, 액세서리 및 디지털 서비스를 판매합니다. EV 및 디지털 차량 기술 및 소프트웨어를 개발합니다. 텔레매틱스 및 EV 충전 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 유통업체와 딜러를 통해 Ford와 Lincoln 차량, 서비스 부품, 액세서리를 판매할 뿐만 아니라 대리점을 통해 상업용 차량 고객, 일일 렌트카 회사, 정부에 판매합니다. 또한, 자동차 딜러를 통해 차량 관련 금융 및 리스 활동도 진행하고 있습니다. 또한 회사는 신규 및 중고 차량에 대한 소매 할부 판매 계약을 제공합니다. 리스 회사, 정부 기관, 일일 렌탈 회사 및 차량 고객과 같은 소매 및 상업 고객을 대상으로 신차에 대한 직접 금융 리스를 제공합니다. 또한 차량 재고 구매 자금을 조달하기 위해 딜러에게 도매 대출을 제공합니다. 운전 자본 조달, 대리점 시설 개선, 대리점 부동산 구매, 기타 대리점 차량 프로그램을 위한 딜러 대출. Ford Motor Company는 1903년에 설립되었으며 미시간주 디어본에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":12.52,"mcap":49995083776.0,"pe":null,"fpe":6.632726,"peg":null,"ps":0.26740342,"pb":1.354099,"ev_ebitda":24.251,"div":4.82,"beta":1.909,"hi52":17.78,"lo52":11.11},"fin":{"rev":186965000192.0,"rev_g":-0.02,"eps_g":-0.167,"gross":0.073860005,"op":0.030769998,"net":-0.041690003,"roe":-0.18431999,"fcf":-6194625024.0,"cash":25088000000.0,"debt":165432999936.0,"de":447.6,"eps":-1.98,"feps":1.88761},"own":{"short":0.0,"inst":0.67768997,"insider":0.00398},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":15.14111,"median":14.12,"high":20.0,"low":12.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.35,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":14.0,"priorPriceTarget":15.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":13.0,"priorPriceTarget":13.5},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":13.0,"priorPrice